<title>USA: Trans Financial INC Q4 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Trans Financial INC Q4 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>BOWLING GREEN, Ky. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.46		    $0.25</p>
<p> Net			  5,300		    2,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,373		   11,293</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.60		    $1.35</p>
<p> Net			  6,882		   15,315</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,373		   11,293</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 provision for loan losses was $2.65 million vs $3.18 million.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 total assets were $1.93 billion versus $1.88 billion.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
